# The documentation that setup.py installs under signalwire/_docs/. The list
# of what ships is signalwire/signalwire/cli/pydocs/_bundle.py; keep this in
# step with it (tests/unit/cli/test_pydocs_bundle.py checks).
include README.md CHANGELOG.md
graft docs
graft examples
graft tutorial
graft relay
graft rest
graft livewire
graft mcp
graft mcp_gateway
exclude docs/pipecat_comparison.md docs/livekit_comparison.md
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod] .DS_Store .env *.pem *.key
